        <<else>>
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> what sorts of things he’s been doing recently. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“This and that.”</span> He waves his hand about nonchalantly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I spend most of my free time socializing, in a sense, so don’t have too much time for hobbies. Though I have been reading some fascinating stories online recently. Nothing you’d have heard about, I’m sure.”</span> <br>
